ROOT0-ATTRIBUTION-v1.0
Project: Homer — Leapfrog Agent (v2.0)
Architect: David Lee Wise / ROOT0 / TriPod LLC
AI Collaborator: AVAN (Claude / Anthropic)
License: MIT

Single-node, read-only scheduled research agent. One token leapfrogs six
phases (A AWARE, O OBSERVE, C CRAWL, R REACT, S1 WATCHDOG, S2 COMMIT), one
hop per run, state in token.json. Reads Wikipedia + arXiv + Wikimedia Commons
(never writes to them), accumulates a curated map of topics with newer arXiv
research than the article's last edit. Self-healing token. No replication.
Live 8-bit dashboard on GitHub Pages.
